{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":30060,\"title\":\"The Plague Dogs\",\"tagline\":\"Escape to a different world...and share the adventure of a lifetime.\",\"overview\":\"Two dogs, Rowf and Snitter, struggle to survive in the countryside after escaping from an animal research laboratory. They're pursued by search parties and then the military after rumours spread that they could be carrying the bubonic plague.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aPlkqs5cmOgaZJhekW5CvGywSkx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/FwV9a72BGBtaRpAEwvPaYfCMon.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":315,\"year\":1982,\"runtime\":103,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":6000000,\"revenue\":423281,\"director\":\"Martin Rosen\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":70663,\"name\":\"Martin Rosen\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r69WDVR0xk8LAo0qfVIIoT7RkSN.jpg\"},{\"id\":5049,\"name\":\"John Hurt\",\"character\":\"Snitter (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjNSzt1d7uK3q5PbtFXUJrRt4qg.jpg\"},{\"id\":94021,\"name\":\"Christopher Benjamin\",\"character\":\"Rowf (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q5n2itp6aUHnGU4tBRSwVyL6ta7.jpg\"},{\"id\":79357,\"name\":\"James Bolam\",\"character\":\"The Tod (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fVVs1Ix6QlZnSitn49KgRR88jfm.jpg\"},{\"id\":15788,\"name\":\"Nigel Hawthorne\",\"character\":\"Dr. Boycott (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v8bin2HUa9gayqxmCnlRlh0taxq.jpg\"},{\"id\":94713,\"name\":\"Warren Mitchell\",\"character\":\"Tyson / Wag (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mMFruuo24m0A8LgVXjE6cUDrGFx.jpg\"},{\"id\":41234,\"name\":\"Judy Geeson\",\"character\":\"Pekinese (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6HXwztsdjeK4QbgKd1sHlheDfx3.jpg\"},{\"id\":2387,\"name\":\"Patrick Stewart\",\"character\":\"Major (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ufqtnLh3JJjPbEgxEag3MM5nZyv.jpg\"},{\"id\":201660,\"name\":\"Brian Stirner\",\"character\":\"Laboratory Assistant (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1613400,\"name\":\"Penelope Lee\",\"character\":\"Lynn Driver (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1458295,\"name\":\"Geoffrey Matthews\",\"character\":\"Farmer (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":8228,\"name\":\"Barbara Leigh-Hunt\",\"character\":\"Farmer's Wife (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mCi9mB0YbB9n4qHsRPF5yGccrft.jpg\"},{\"id\":47547,\"name\":\"John Bennett\",\"character\":\"Don (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/arSkPpoGcRyqSdx4iAE9DtBc2Z8.jpg\"},{\"id\":16697,\"name\":\"John Franklyn-Robbins\",\"character\":\"Williamson (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hpKBMsvLCmXk7BK2UzMBaZGTWHU.jpg\"},{\"id\":86105,\"name\":\"Bill Maynard\",\"character\":\"Editor (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uU4i1l0jozXzXolhHkUoparSrM7.jpg\"},{\"id\":26858,\"name\":\"Malcolm Terris\",\"character\":\"Robert (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2gNzDwzlpE6g6PDPydHZdgynIIj.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":791523,\"title\":\"Wildwood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snFM00mpNAfUzUtkdEW0uDEvXA0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sl5NJ1vtyhP9Vr88bB4blULsJYp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prue and her classmate Curtis are drawn into a magical forest filled with enchanted creatures, loyal allies, and formidable adversaries as they embark on a desperate quest to rescue Prue's abducted baby brother from a murder of crows led by a mysterious woman named Alexandra.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1560520,\"title\":\"Batman: Knightfall Part 1: Knightfall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/360qdtu2hLnqMu8SVHMywn420w1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/caBIySpwuFi2i7ynvHIlnxJLOdN.jpg\",\"rating\":9.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Arkham Asylum has been destroyed, and all its inmates have been unleashed upon Gotham City. As Batman races to round up some of his greatest enemies, he is pushed to his physical and mental limits and into a final confrontation with a new threat: the man called Bane!\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":150540,\"title\":\"Inside Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jJKZaTBNenlFclQyjrnvzkRmvWE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420818,\"title\":\"The Lion King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dzBtMocZuJbjLOXvrl4zGYigDzh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TUg5pO1VZ4B0Q1amk3OlXvlpXV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub's arrival. Scar, Mufasa's brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba's exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":260514,\"title\":\"Cars 3\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zg5RDxvIIAKsucjuU2EZJIHEIvz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wvBO5vBrFQtQpJPWx83JYuysr4f.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Blindsided by a new generation of blazing-fast racers, the legendary Lightning McQueen finds himself pushed to the brink—and suddenly, the champion who once ruled the track is fighting just to stay in the race. With his career hanging in the balance, McQueen must turn to an ambitious young race technician with a plan of her own, draw strength from the legacy of the late Fabulous Hudson Hornet, and risk everything on one last shot at glory.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9023,\"title\":\"Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bBEkKDQFianNYwGWR7gJfPVakmG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b8hPBW0NJmiIVzvQjT3CwIpAdzl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Against impossible odds, Spirit, a young mustang, sets out across the majestic wilderness to regain his freedom and save his homeland. Along the way, he forms a friendship with a young Lakota brave, outwits a squadron of soldiers, and ultimately, finds love.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1167307,\"title\":\"David\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7lFG1WrCwAxBfyGK8ahlBVzXno7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mZ6J2g6HCV2gj3iuCdSxcyBXq9c.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From the songs of his mother’s heart to the whispers of a faithful God, David’s story begins in quiet devotion. When the giant Goliath rises to terrorize a nation, a young shepherd armed with only a sling, a few stones, and unshakable faith steps forward. Pursued by power and driven by purpose, his journey tests the limits of loyalty, love, and courage—culminating in a battle not just for a crown, but for the soul of a kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":995133,\"title\":\"The Boy, the Mole, the Fox and the Horse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wAKBWRhMmBtrCCuqmFwPm2RGTph.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wO0MIGcA7w7tBI9Ey80Q4Z7qnPm.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The unlikely friendship of a boy, a mole, a fox and a horse traveling together in the boy's search for home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10567,\"title\":\"Dinosaur\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rSje3FS7ycJSglowlngjsvDt7vO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/laeEtakR2pLKu3CeRwB2lU5Y53X.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An orphaned dinosaur raised by lemurs joins an arduous trek to a sancturary after a meteorite shower destroys his family home.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844135,\"title\":\"Charlotte\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/goUoo1DiQen9TT6sBT6o4LW5cQs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/31K5cQkG7o6fQjLMOcOG7bi8OpN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The true story of Charlotte Salomon, a young German-Jewish painter who comes of age in Berlin on the eve of the Second World War. Fiercely imaginative and deeply gifted, she dreams of becoming an artist. Her first love applauds her talent, which emboldens her resolve. When anti-Semitic policies inspire violent mobs, she escapes to the safety of the South of France. There she begins to paint again, and finds new love. But her work is interrupted, this time by a family tragedy that reveals an even darker secret. Believing that only an extraordinary act will save her, she embarks on the monumental adventure of painting her life story.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843843,\"title\":\"Suddenly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x5Xj72BQVNzk6lREDwNuYt4FLoX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mInqo4SQCjDgN5dDIJDa52UMETl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben and Laura are a passionate but volatile couple who embark on a round-the-world sailing adventure to give their relationship a new start. During their trip, they decide to explore a vast deserted island which they discover off the coast of Chile. Caught in a violent storm, they shelter in an abandoned whaling station for the night but wake up the next morning to find their boat has disappeared. Stranded in a hostile environment with no means of communication, dwindling supplies and winter approaching they must work together in a life and death battle for survival, that will challenge their feelings and change their relationship forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"0vqWzquBh0c\",\"name\":\"Plague Dogs - Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}